flowchart TD
    A{Relational database?}
    A -->|Yes| B{Need a specific database engine?}
    B -->|MySQL or PostgreSQL| C{Need cloud-native MySQL/PostgreSQL performance, serverless, or global read replicas?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Aurora MySQL or Aurora PostgreSQL]
    C -->|No| E[RDS for MySQL or RDS for PostgreSQL]
    B -->|MariaDB| F[RDS for MariaDB]
    B -->|Oracle| G[RDS for Oracle]
    B -->|SQL Server| H[RDS for SQL Server]
    B -->|Migration constraints or engine portability| I[Evaluate RDS engine support and DMS, or re-evaluate Aurora compatibility requirements]
    A -->|No| J{Key-value or document NoSQL?}
    J -->|Yes| K[DynamoDB]
    J -->|No| L{In-memory caching?}
    L -->|Yes| M[ElastiCache Redis or Memcached]
    L -->|No| N{Analytics / OLAP data warehouse?}
    N -->|Yes| O[Redshift]
    N -->|No| P[Revisit requirements]
